notes.content:
made b position forecast working for player with fast connection to server receiving data of player with slow connection to server (slowly connected players previously already see forecasted positions of other players b); 
 increased possible simultaneously played audios from 32 to 255


Note: Forecast removes step-wise animation but has been observed to cause stutter when the forecast is wrong (eg. being too far ahead and repeatedly getting put back on a straight path with constant speed; particularly this scenario ought be smooth with forecast and the cause of the discrepancy is being attempted to get figured out.)

free floating camera by left mouse button click, use mouse wheel to zoom, left-click again to toggle back; 
 Depth of Field effect around tree; 
 faster network update speed
